The plate looks like a side plate of about 20 cm. It holds roughly 3 to 4 strips of cooked bacon, and the strips look crispy and thin.

Cooked bacon runs about 8 g per strip, or around 10 g for thicker strips, and about 45 kcal per strip (roughly 540 kcal per 100 g). At 4 strips that comes to about 32 g and about 170 kcal.

